WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:03,080
Impossible

2
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:10,900
Still angry about Yaoyao

3
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:17,260
She and I are just friends. She clings to me enough. I don’t want to hear it. Then let me ask you.

4
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:18,660
how many of you are there

5
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:20,340
What special abilities do teammates have?

6
00:00:20,780 --> 00:00:21,900
Will you tell outsiders?

7
00:00:22,730 --> 00:00:23,850
I love you again Suzy

8
00:00:24,370 --> 00:00:26,050
It's also impossible to sell teammates.

9
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:29,610
I'm an outsider, right?

10
00:00:30,170 --> 00:00:35,820
Who am I to you? I've had enough.

11
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:37,180
starting from today

12
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:39,460
We are just strangers

13
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:42,180
Don't regret it, senior sister

14
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:43,780
Breakfast is served here in the morning

15
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:46,700
The little lady said you came down without eating and asked me to find you.

16
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:50,820
Come down, come down

17
00:00:51,140 --> 00:01:01,980
I didn’t even wipe my hair for fear that you would be hungry. Who are you? Don’t make trouble. We are talking about something. You go up first.

18
00:01:05,730 --> 00:01:08,350
It turns out there is someone else. No wonder he is so desperate.

19
00:01:09,880 --> 00:01:10,840
You slept with her
